{"id":"565941177","kind":"article","title":"电子阅读时，并排阅读基本上不可能","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8KaXwxWaMdUbhKa3RC2zN8ZB36gfvWcoWmwR"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-09-19","updated":"2023-04-10","votes":11,"comment_count":6,"minutes":1,"chars":371,"keywords":["电子阅读","并行阅读","阅读软件","参考资料检索"],"summary":"作者指出，电子阅读器难以同时查看同一本书中不相邻的页面，查阅章节对应的参考书目往往要反复翻页；数字复制粘贴也缺少纸面剪贴所保留的并行中间状态。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/565941177","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"cAjH-wWk\">据我所知，没有 PDF 或 EPUB 阅读器，允许读者一次查看同一本书的多篇不相邻的页面。如果你要查看手头章节对应的那部分参考书目，你需要来回翻动页面。我只知道 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2fGXCnKwFV1jDmKsp15wkbV5WHSnLpy52Mq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LiquidText</a> 是常见阅读软件中的唯一例外。</p><p data-pid=\"g2CmT3NM\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6VMTBKqURcGfZa7Kj24U8wqTCS4vXukuCizB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">物理剪切和粘贴是并行的，并会存在不严格的中间状态</a>，然而电子的复制粘贴也并非如此，于是问题更严重了。</p><p data-pid=\"7ZiMHhhd\">相关笔记：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7ZNevNutwN3wT5hTRLUipssHBNbxUWSyDHrr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子阅读很难保持多个阅读位置</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"21RPbufP\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"617153188\" href=\"#/post/617153188\">电子阅读很难维持多个阅读位置</a></li><li data-pid=\"zaZD-hyj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"620532040\" href=\"#/post/620532040\">在电脑上阅读文本令人不快</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"tK_Q4Oar\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8KaXwxWaMdUbhKa3RC2zN8ZB36gfvWcoWmwR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Parallel reading is mostly impossible in digital reading (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 电子阅读很难维持多个阅读位置 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"617153188\" href=\"#/post/617153188\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"562411559","title":"游戏帮助玩家制定和调整计划","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"569345567","title":"情景体验需要由参与者的行动控制","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"620532040","title":"在电脑上阅读文本令人不快","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":25,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"617153188","title":"电子阅读很难维持多个阅读位置","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}